 "limits": "Greedy first fit: a later high-value request can be blocked by an earlier lower-priority one in the same priority band, and no request is moved once placed. Times are local wall-clock times without time zones or daylight saving changes. A provider serves one appointment at a time. Patient or client consent, reminders and cancellations are out of scope.",
